{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910423001:1":{"text":"触手男挺厉害，狩猎用不着咱帮忙——咱保证，他没有伤害浅海裔。","source_cn":"触手男挺厉害，狩猎用不着咱帮忙——咱保证，他没有伤害浅海裔。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x01F3FFA7ED58A7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910423002:1":{"text":"闲着也是闲着，咱就去找了不少修理和改装水行器的材料。咳...","source_cn":"闲着也是闲着，咱就去找了不少修理和改装水行器的材料。咳...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910423003:1":{"text":"就是……在塔拉萨挺受欢迎的那种。","source_cn":"就是……在塔拉萨挺受欢迎的那种。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x31D7143CB0D8A579","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910423004:1":{"text":"海螺？你说的是……","source_cn":"海螺？你说的是……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x87F08ECBD364D025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910423005:0":{"text":"……就……就你之前在家，缠着你姐想要的那种。","source_cn":"……就……就你之前在家，缠着你姐想要的那种。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x70FBA439C064C36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docum